  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Response to food insecurity crisis and support to UNHAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this WFP project is to ensure access to food through the provision of life-saving food assistance for IDPs, and to enable humanitarian access to some of the most hard-to-reach areas in the country. The project provides hot meals and cash-based transfer, in addition to air service for the humanitarian community. The intervention provides humanitarian assistance to 24,000 people (5,041 men, 4800 women, 14,159 children), including 1,680 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
